---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact Us | Peaks and Puddles" description="Get in touch with Peaks and Puddles about forest nursery gear, Scottish family adventures, or vetted brand partnerships.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-8">
    <article class="prose max-w-none">
      <h1>Get in Touch</h1>
      <p>
        Whether you have a question about sizing Nordic waterproofs over winter layers, want to suggest a piece of forest nursery kit for us to look at, or represent an outdoor brand interested in working together, I would love to hear from you.
      </p>

      <div class="my-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--muted)]/40 p-6">
        <p class="mt-0 font-semibold">Direct Email</p>
        <p class="mb-0">
          <a href="mailto:hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk" class="text-lg font-bold">
            hello@peaksandpuddles.co.uk
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Brand Partnerships &amp; Gear Testing</h2>
      <p>
        We welcome enquiries from technical kids' outdoor brands, independent UK outdoor retailers, and family-friendly outdoor destinations. Please note that we only partner with brands whose products meet genuine real-world weather and durability standards, and all sponsored placements are clearly disclosed to our readers.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>